<title>POLAND: ZYWIEC PLANS PLN 2 PAYOUT FOR 1996.</title>
<headline>ZYWIEC PLANS PLN 2 PAYOUT FOR 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish brewer Zywiec SA plans to pay a 1996 dividend of two zlotys per share, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Zywiec said the company's supervisory board had accepted management's proposal to pay the dividend but said the decision had to be approved at a general shareholders meeting planned for May 13.</p>
<p>Last year Zywiec paid a two-zloty dividend.</p>
<p>In 1996 Zywiec made a net profit of 8.1 million zlotys on sales of 368 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
